  "result": "Perfect! The late fees feature is complete and all tests pass. Here's what was implemented:\n\n## Summary\n\n**Added `lateFee(invoice, asOf)` to `src/reports.js`** that:\n- Calculates a late fee of 0.04% of the amount still due for every day the invoice is overdue\n- Returns 0 if the invoice is not overdue (dueDate >= asOf)\n- Returns 0 if there's no amount due (fully paid invoices)\n- Uses `balanceDue` to calculate the amount owed, which accounts for partial payments, discounts, and VAT\n- Uses `daysBetween` to calculate the number of days overdue\n- Uses `roundCents` for precise cent calculations with banker's rounding\n\n**Added 16 comprehensive tests to `test/reports.test.js`** covering:\n- Not overdue scenarios (returns 0)\n- 1, 10, and 30 day overdue calculations\n- Fully paid invoices (no fee)\n- Partially paid invoices (fee on remaining balance)\n- Large overdue amounts\n- Discount and VAT application\n- Multiple line items\n- Cross-year dates\n- Rounding edge cases\n- Status-independent fee calculation\n\n**Results:** All 294 tests pass (278 existing + 16 new lateFee tests).",
